
This repository's code was copied from the ATLAS TDAQ package "config"
(https://gitlab.cern.ch/atlas-tdaq-software/config/) (from its 67a24e731 commit on its master branch) in November 2022; the
carbon copy of that code can be found in commit
cfca638154a48962fd03bf9bafcded9801f0b324 in this repo. Since then, the
code has been refactored for the DUNE DAQ and the package has been
renamed from "config" to "conffwk".

